# Deterministic seed-0 barge-in report (n=150): a committed BUILD INPUT for the
# dashboard, so CI/keyless builds are hermetic. build_data.py reads it verbatim
# and still never hardcodes its numbers. Regenerate with:
#   uv run --group piper python packages/experiments/run_bargein_harness.py --n 150 --seed 0
!experiments/bargein_report.json
experiments/*.jsonl
